1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:10,525
Modern models can see images and hear speech. Photograph a receipt, and get back the vendor, date, items and total as data.

2
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:19,470
But models can misread numbers, which matters a lot for money. Always check that the items add up to the total.

3
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:31,180
Decide what to extract, ask for structured output with an unsure option, validate it in code, and send doubtful cases to a person.

4
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:38,505
Images and audio cost more tokens than text, so resize images to what you need.

5
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:45,860
Photos and voices are personal data. Get consent, and keep as little as possible.

6
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:56,385
Speech to text gives you meeting notes and captions. Text to speech reads aloud. Test with your real users' accents.

7
00:00:57,080 --> 00:01:03,805
Never present generated images as real photos, and respect copyright and consent.

